1. SCOPE
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license covers the original work created by the Author in this repository:
Outlaw OS's own source code, configuration, build scripts, branding, artwork,
text, and the "Outlaw OS" / "Outlaw CodeMaker" names (collectively, "the Work").

It does NOT cover third-party components that Outlaw OS bundles, installs, or
depends on (the Linux kernel, Arch packages, Electron, Steam, Godot, Python
libraries, fonts, etc.). Those remain under their own respective licenses, and
nothing here grants or restricts rights in them beyond what their licenses say.

